# bote_schema_ref.tcyr — `$ref` within its document (3.8.10): pointers into `$defs` and
# anywhere, escaped and percent-encoded, the root and recursion, anchors and the root's `$id`,
# siblings, under composition; registration's refusals (nothing there, another document, no
# schema, bad anchors, a resource of its own, and cycles that judge a value by itself); a
# ToolSchema's references in the listed inputSchema; a result; the depth a judgement may
# reach on a worker's stack; the WARNs; and the heap and the arena.
#
# Run: cyrius test tests/bote_schema_ref.tcyr

